**Convention 11.2 (quantitative frontier and recoverable information).**
The credited frontier remains

$$
\frac18\log_2\frac{33}{13}\le\lambda<\frac3{16},\qquad M_1(3)=4,
\tag{GDB.49}
$$

with lower from [NCE, Theorems 6.1–6.2][NCE] and upper and finite value
from [D3, Theorems 2.3 and 4.1][D3]. General exact $M_1(D)$,
sharp $\lambda$, effective all-size optimized convergence and the broader
minimal-relations/internal-observer/mutual-recovery programme remain open.
The operational recovery used here, under the paid services, is exactly

$$
(E(t),D,p,\text{at most one actual reply})
\longrightarrow\Gamma_p(t)
\longleftrightarrow\bigl(r_{\rho^kt}(p)\bigr)_{k\ge0}.
\tag{GDB.50}
$$

Its reverse recovers the first branch count and alpha-stage flag.
For a contracted component the selected actual owner reply also
determines its phase on the named fiber. These conclusions recover
neither the full hidden source in general, an unknown age, an unseen
history, a physical space-time realization nor the access services.

